WEBVTT

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:33.670
Shuurei had finally managed to persuade the Merchants Guild,

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.240
but she still had one more great task to complete.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.080
At the court conference that had been urgently convened,

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:48.790
she needed to win over all the prominent officials in attendance.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.750
She is overstepping the boundaries of her authority!

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:03.570
It is outrageously selfish!

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:04.220
That is correct.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:08.130
Not even once did she bring this business to a court conference.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.860
Doing things so arbitrarily...

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.730
Seriously, youth nowadays, what do they think is the purpose of the Imperial Court?

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:14.550
How deplorable.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.390
If only our previous emperor was still alive.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:43.140
Sashuu Governor Kou Shuurei has come at the request of Your Highness.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:49.900
I would like to express my gratitude to Your Highness for your assistance in this matter.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.150
Has the Merchants Guild taken action, Governor Kou?

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.210
Yes, they will provide full assistance.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.560
In three days time, I will depart for Sashuu.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:05.690
I would like to take this occasion to announce that Tei Yuushun and I are departing.

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:11.290
H-Hold on!

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:15.960
You have gone too far in just one day!

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:17.910
This is almost like asking for ex-post-facto approval!

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.130
On top of that, you obtained their agreement through bluffing.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.290
What do you think is the purpose of the Imperial Court?!

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:25.350
I thought its purpose was to help our people,

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.640
but am I wrong?

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.810
If the answer is different, please tell me.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.220
What do you think is the purpose of the Imperial Court?

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:37.770
We have run out of time to save the suffering people of Sashuu.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:41.570
That's why I have omitted certain procedures. Is that a problem?

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.820
You cannot omit things like that so easily!

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.460
That is right.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:49.340
Did you think you could get away with taking such a reckless approach?

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:51.590
Yes, it's reckless.

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:52.790
Of course I know that.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.350
However, if normal procedures were followed,

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.990
when would the approval be given and all the preparations be completed?

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.800
Ten days later? Half a month later?

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:07.390
If we acted so languidly, by the time we brought doctors to Sashuu, there wouldn't be any patients left!

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:11.770
What excuse could I offer in front of the numerous graves?!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:15.020
If we followed normal procedure, it would be too late.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.490
That doesn't mean you can do what you like!

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.360
Indeed! Life or death is a matter of luck!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:25.280
A matter of luck! Luck, is it? Yes, such factors must play a role.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:29.050
So if your child was ill,

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:32.400
but the governor followed methodical procedures to obtain each approval,

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.290
and thus by the time a doctor reached you, it was too late, and your child was dead...

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.060
Would you think it was a matter of luck and be content?

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.630
O-Of course.

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.630
"If only the doctor had arrived just a little sooner..."

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.180
You can say absolutely that you wouldn't have such regrets?

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:55.960
So, in that case, even if my child falls ill, it will all be a matter of luck?

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.370
Of course not, Your Highness!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:00.980
Of course we'd come to your aid immediately, by any means possible!

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:05.240
Why won't you allow our people to be treated the same way?

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:11.620
As long as taxes are paid, you don't care if the payers are different than the previous time?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.740
Somewhere, don't you believe that no matter how many people die, others will be born?

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.410
Somewhere, don't you believe that our people are disposable?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.250
That they can be replaced?

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:26.000
Aren't you forgetting that, in a faraway land, there are people clinging to life, dying and crying?

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:30.740
Because you can't see the faces of our people, you may feel that they are all the same.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:35.030
But each one of them is precious to somebody!

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.770
As government officials, whom should we protect?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:49.290
There are matters that an individual cannot accomplish, but I have power now!

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.410
I have persuaded the Merchants Guild.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:56.160
I have managed to gather skilled physicians!

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.300
In three days, I will depart for Sashuu.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.680
Within half a month, I will arrive at Koringun and begin the treatments.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:07.880
The Kou Shuurei of a year ago could not have done this.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.140
I could not do this now if I had not received my office and rank!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:18.930
What is the point of having power, if one does not make use of it?

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:26.070
In these hands, there is the power to save people!

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:32.160
People can accomplish many things by themselves.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:36.210
But there are things commoners can't do, no matter how hard they try.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.790
Doing things like that is what an Emperor should do, isn't it?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.020
If the Emperor is loafing on the job, who else will do it?

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.870
It is a sin not to do what you can.

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:52.220
If you can save more lives by being reckless, isn't it worth it?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.900
To leave this matter to luck and not try my best,

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:58.110
and then stand in front of the graves and say "Just bad luck!" with a smile...

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:01.320
Never in my life could I say that!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.180
Even if it is reckless, I will do everything that I can.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.440
I am delighted that I have become a government official,

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:12.070
and if I can save someone with my power,

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.750
then I can be proud of being a government official!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.880
That kind of government official is what I want to be!

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:21.220
"What purpose do government officials serve?"

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:24.250
When I was a scholar, someone told me to ask myself that at all times.

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:26.630
I already have the answer.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.240
I am a government official!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.760
You are returning to Sashuu, no matter what?

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:35.010
Of course.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:42.770
Th-That's right. I hear that the outbreak of disease is your fault!

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:46.620
What Jyasen-kyou is claiming is partly true!

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:50.550
This occurred as soon as you became governor.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:55.380
After all, a woman should not enter the holy realm of politics!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.470
Th-The former Emperor?

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:19.330
Indeed, there was such a report.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.690
You will return nonetheless?

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:23.680
Yes.

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:27.530
Even if your action will provoke Jyasen-kyou?

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.310
I have to go.

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:32.720
I am a Governor of Sashuu.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:36.440
If it is my fault, all the more reason I have to go there myself.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:43.040
To settle the matter, I must confront those who are spreading the rumor.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:47.530
A treatment has been found, and we are fully prepared to battle this disease.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:52.090
What remains now is for me to take measures against Jyasen-kyou on the spot.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:59.760
To Eigetsu and I lack experience. That's why the two of us are joint governors.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:04.600
Where do you expect I would be, and what do you expect I would do, other than be in Sashuu?

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:08.450
No matter what is said, or by whom, for the sake of the official rank that I was given...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:18.620
and for the sake of this flower, I will return to Sashuu.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:30.170
If it turns out that the disease breakout was your fault, you said you would take measures against it.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.820
To begin with, I will venture into Jyasen-kyou territory.

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:34.800
That is too dangerous!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:35.540
You will be putting your life at risk!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:39.050
You are a governor. What about your duties?

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:42.680
I have considered that already. Please do not worry.

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:44.930
I will fulfill my duties as a governor.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.920
Sashuu was beginning to show signs of peace.

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.310
I cannot overlook those who would cause disorder!

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.690
I will give an order to dispatch the army!

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:04.220
Th-The Imperial Army is going to the front?

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.380
Subjugation under the order of the Emperor, which means...

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.790
The first Imperial Army expedition since the former Emperor?!

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:10.960
Please hold on a moment!

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:36.730
As a Governor of Sashuu, I refuse the offer of intervention by the Imperial Army.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:47.070
Why do you think Governor To and the others have postponed dispatching Sashuu's army until now?

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:56.180
Numerous innocent people have joined Jyasen-kyou,
believing that this would protect them from falling ill.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:03.510
Is it not obvious what action Jyasen-kyou will take  when they hear that the Imperial Army is intervening?

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:09.020
Use of the Imperial Army will solve the problem with Jyasen-kyou by force.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:12.230
But, how many lives will be lost that way?

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:18.030
The reason why I am venturing into Jyasen-kyou territory is not in order to stir things up.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:23.660
They must want to contact me if they say they will capture me and make me a human sacrifice.

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:27.040
First, we must respond urgently to the outbreak of disease,

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.660
then I will come up with a plan to deal with Jyasen-kyou cautiously and swiftly.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:34.410
Giving priority to saving people's lives, I will bring this problem to an end!

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:39.910
Of course, when I send them to prison,
I will need help from the provincial army.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:43.960
Even so, I want to do my best to minimize the damage!

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:53.690
Your Highness, rather than dispatching the Imperial Army, I would like your assistance elsewhere.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:56.440
Go ahead.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:12:01.190
I would like Officer Tei to go to Koren Castle to support Sashuu.

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:06.890
I would like military Officer Shi, and the Shishuu provincial army, to be dispatched with him as his guards.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.320
What about yourself?

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:16.340
Beyond Sairi fortress, I will part ways with Officer Tei, and go directly to Koringun with the medical team.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:21.960
Please do not worry. I will ask Officer Rou to accompany me.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:25.160
No man can get past his guard.

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:29.630
Please trust me and leave the matter to me.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.920
I am the Emperor of Saiunkoku...

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:51.870
Very well, I will not dispatch the army.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:57.750
Go and accomplish what you need to, Sashuu Governor Kou Shuurei!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.290
Yes, Your Highness.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.290
It's all done, Father.

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:24.610
Preparations are complete.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:38.480
You're leaving tomorrow?

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:40.270
Yes.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:54.160
What if Jyasen-kyou was right, and the disease was my fault?

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.980
That's definitely not true.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.090
I'm really sorry that I have to leave you, Father.

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:03.050
Don't worry. You'll come back safe and sound.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:07.030
I always make you worry, Father.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.900
Yes, all the time. I always worry about you.

00:14:11.590 --> 00:14:13.700
So come back.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.490
Not just for me.

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:17.910
Many people care about you.

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:19.660
So come back.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:25.710
If you'd stay just because I told you to, I'd tell you over and over again.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.420
No... I have to go.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:32.260
Ensei and Eigetsu are doing their best.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:32.880
They're waiting for me.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:36.270
In situations like this, you're allowed to say you don't want to go.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.140
That's something I can never say.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:44.220
Shuurei, just promise me one thing.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.350
Don't try to do everything yourself.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:51.030
Allow yourself to get angry or to cry by someone's side.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.780
If you do, Ensei will come to help you.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:58.410
He will smile, no matter what.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:00.830
It's not your fault.

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:03.920
I'm sorry, Father...

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:05.820
Seiran...

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:12.520
Master.

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:15.430
You must be having a hard time too, Seiran.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:16.430
Not at all.

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:20.450
It galls me, but I can trust Ensei to protect her.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.330
Although this time we are entrusting her to Ensei,

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:29.940
it has always been you who stayed and supported Shuurei and me.

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.670
Both Shuurei and I love you.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:36.940
You are one of our precious family.

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:43.590
Ensei is probably the only person to whom you can entrust Shuurei.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.840
Nobody else but you could say it.
That's why my mind can be at peace.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:51.250
The only man I know who is stronger than Ensei is his master.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:52.980
It'll be fine, Master.

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:55.310
And are you all right?

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.720
Yes, I won't allow Ensei to take care of Mistress all alone.

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:05.840
Seiran, Shuurei can manage on her own, but that doesn't mean she can live alone.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.480
That's also true for you or any other person.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:11.500
I can't go to Sashuu for her.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:16.630
Although I can't stay beside her, there are things I can do for her.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:18.270
Please take care of her.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.640
Yes, certainly.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.100
Reishin-sama, she'll come back.

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.380
When she does, treat her to mandarins again.

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:41.280
She really appreciated them.

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:45.190
It's uninspiring to give the same gifts. Think of something else.

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:48.400
Something that will outwit Kurou.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:49.940
I'll do my best.

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.530
I had a proposal of marriage from Kurou-sama, but...

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.950
I'm... quite happy the way I am.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:03.460
Shuurei and I are really busy with what we have to do right now.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:07.710
If we can have mandarins together now and then, that's enough for us.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:09.710
Whatever you wish.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.110
She'll come back.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:17.100
Our country and this and that, she's taken a liking for such troublesome stuff...

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:22.150
I can give her anything else, but... she leaves me nothing to give.

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.990
She was happy to have the mandarins.

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:25.990
Of course.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:29.180
I've researched them and improved them for Shuurei.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.370
She was pleased that time too.

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:35.320
Here.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.960
But you, you were never cute, ever since I picked you up!

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:55.710
Reishin-sama picked me up of his own accord!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:10.680
Huh? I fell asleep?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.120
I feel great after crying so much!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:19.870
I'm fine now.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:35.290
Have I made them seriously worry about me?

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.540
I'm upset.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.430
Wha- you're here?

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:10.440
What's wrong with me being here?

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:11.930
This is my palace.

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.040
You're in an odd mood.

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:19.050
For the last few days, I've only been served meat from morning to evening.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:25.470
Ah, because the medical team is practicing surgery on all the pigs and cows they could find...

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.130
But you had some fish too, didn't you?

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:29.460
It doesn't matter, they're all meat after all.

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:31.570
I wanted to eat vegetables!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:33.340
I'm upset!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.450
I hate Shuurei!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:38.450
Ryuuki...

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.030
Shuurei doesn't understand a man's feelings, that painful longing.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:45.820
That's why no one will want to marry Shuurei except me.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:47.990
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:52.470
When I get back, I'll cook you your favorite vegetable dishes.

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:55.170
Play the ehru for me too.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:56.450
Yes, I will.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.290
Go for a walk with me too.

00:19:58.680 --> 00:19:59.480
Yes, I will.

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:00.870
Marry me!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:01.590
No.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.790
Will you look this way now?

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:06.240
No.

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:07.520
Why not?

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.550
If I see your face, I might grab you.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:15.350
I mean, I think I won't be able to let you go!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:18.620
It's too late to put on airs now.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.360
This is the first time you've said you hate me.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.280
Well, it's not like I'm going there to die.

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:30.010
I'll manage somehow.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.270
If you don't come back, I'll be a window for the rest of my life.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:32.910
Window?

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.710
Shou-Taishi told me it's a commoner's word for being single.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:40.210
You mean widower? How are you supposed to become a window?

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:43.460
That old fart, feeding me lies again!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.060
You said you'll cook me vegetable dishes?

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:51.050
Yes.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:54.310
I want to eat delicious Sashuu vegetable dishes.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:00.950
Of course.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.380
I don't hate you. It was a lie.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:14.020
I'll be waiting.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:34.600
As head of the Sa family, I would like to express my utmost gratitude to Your Highness.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:37.680
On behalf of our brethren suffering from disease,

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:40.870
Your Highness has graciously permitted the provincial governors to act swiftly.

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:42.490
I am entirely overwhelmed.

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:45.870
Words are incapable of conveying the deep sense of gratitude that I feel.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:50.090
From this moment, the entire Sa family will obey Emperor Shi Ryuuki.

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:53.740
With the sword of principle and the shield of remonstrance, we shall serve Your Highness loyally.

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:57.290
I accept, head of the Sa family.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.500
Exceed Sa Enjun, just as your name says.

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:07.260
I expect you not to bring shame to the former head of the family, the Chrysanthemum Master.

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:11.370
Yes, Your Highness, I shall succeed to the pride and honor of the Chrysanthemum Master.

00:22:27.730 --> 00:22:28.560
Shuurei...

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.240
Your Highness, about the dispatch of the Imperial Army...

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:36.600
You gave the order knowing that Shuurei would refuse.

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:38.860
If Shuurei had agreed, I would have dispatched them.

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:42.630
But... you knew the answer.

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:45.790
I need Shuurei to succeed in her career.

00:22:46.270 --> 00:22:49.360
In Shuurei's way, as only Shuurei can do.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:54.630
This time, she will fail and die or succeed and live.

00:22:56.440 --> 00:22:58.590
Shuurei will come back alive.

00:22:59.320 --> 00:22:59.750
Yes.

00:23:03.950 --> 00:23:07.010
What's this? Why are you being so kind?

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:09.810
You've put up with it so well.

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:13.420
There are two of them. Let's eat them together.

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:14.870
All right.

00:24:43.730 --> 00:24:44.950
It's time to go to Sashuu!

00:24:44.950 --> 00:24:46.430
Hang on, Eigetsu-kun!

00:24:46.430 --> 00:24:51.110
Now General Rai, let's spur on the horses as fast as we can and get to Sashuu in a flash!

00:24:51.540 --> 00:24:54.760
What? We can't pass through Sairi fortress, the checkpoint of Sashuu?

00:24:54.760 --> 00:24:55.510
But why?!
